                  <div>
                    <p className="text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Add Nodes to the Canvas</p>
                    <p className="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                      Click agents from the <span className="text-amber font-medium">left palette</span> to add them as nodes. You can add your global agents, project agents, or custom steps with free-form instructions. Use <span className="font-medium text-text-secondary">+ Custom Step</span> for nodes with manual instructions.
                    </p>
